<title>USA: Ampal-American stake raised by Rebar.</title>
<headline>Ampal-American stake raised by Rebar.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rebar Financial Corp said Thursday it has increased its stake in Ampal-American Israel Corp's outstanding Class A shares to 8,105,652 shares, or 34.2 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the investor said it bought an additional 443,900 shares of the New York based investment company between April 10 and April 23 at $5 each.</p>
